{"school":{"dbn":"16K267","name":"M.S. 267 Math, Science & Technology","boro":"Brooklyn","district":"16","district_label":"District 16","report_type":"EMS","report_types":"EMS","school_type":"Middle","grades":"6 to 8","status":"open","enrollment":142,"enrollment_year":"2024-25","address":"800 GATES AVENUE, BROOKLYN, NY 11221","phone":"718-571-6960","website":"www.ms267.org","directory_url":"https://www.myschools.nyc/en/schools/middle-school/62249","accessibility":"Fully Accessible","overview":"Brazilian novelist Paolo Coelho once said, \u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u009cThe world is changed by your example not by your opinion.\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u009d At MS267, we live by this creed. A gemstone in the heart of Bedford Stuyvesant, MS267 shines by example every day. Naturally, we focus on academic excellence, on rigor and its rewards, but to encourage robust learning, we place even greater emphasis on each child\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s educational experience. And so we cultivate intradisciplinary Math, English, Social Studies, and Science curricula, courses of study that culturally respond to modern interests\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0094with Regents offerings in the 8th grade. We pursue classes collaboratively, prioritizing student voices in vigorous debates, deep projects, and individualized conferences. We emphasize both educational and socio-emotional support, facilitating students\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099 engagement with our wealth of personalized resources for advisement. And we provide student-created enrichments, classes that foster our students\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099 diverse passions\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0094last year, we ran courses in basketball, culinary arts, cosmetology, poetry, and robotics, just to name a few. Yes, through integrated curricula, deep support systems, and myriad activities, we nurture each student, ensuring their growth into intellectuals and inventors, into artists and engineers\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0094into citizens of the modern world. \n\nWith such an approach, it\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s no surprise that MS267 has recorded District 16\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s top Mathematics and English test scores for five years running. It\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s no surprise that we received a perfect score in 2019\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s New York State Quality Review. It\u00c3\u0083\u00c2\u00a2\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0080\u00c3\u0082\u00c2\u0099s no surprise that we were, last year, named a top school by an independent monitoring body. After all, at MS267, we believe that each child can learn. We believe that each child is part of our family, a young person who deserves a deeply individualized, uniquely supportive environment. And we believe that, given such nurturing, our students will change the world by their example.\n---\nMission Statement: the MS267 community will work relentlessly to empower our scholars in high school, college, and beyond.","start_time":"8:20am","end_time":"2:40pm","languages":null,"subway":"J to Kosciusko St","bus":"B15, B26, B38, B46, B46-SBS, B47, B52, Q24","shared_building":"1","neighborhood":"Bedford Stuyvesant","latitude":40.687946,"longitude":-73.932375,"coordinate_source":"geocoded","first_year":"2015-16","last_year":"2024-25"},"series":{"attendance_inperson_k8_all":{"y":["2020-21"],"v":[0.89],"st":["ok"],"n":[67.0]},"attendance_k8_all":{"y":["2018-19","2019-20","2020-21","2021-22","2022-23","2023-24","2024-25"],"v":[0.871,0.875,0.9